# .forge-local/ is the WORKSTATION EXECUTION PLANE (Sacrosanct 3.1 s10.6 / s21.2).
#
# Expanded third-party sources, build trees, compiled objects, prefixes, model
# weights and caches live here and are excluded from ordinary commits. Only
# manifests, recipes, patches and reproducibility metadata belong in Git — those
# live under third_party/ and tools/deps/.
#
# This file is the ONLY tracked thing in here: it documents the layout and keeps
# the directory itself present, so tooling has somewhere to write without an
# extra mkdir dance.
*
!.gitignore

# Layout (created on demand by tools/deps/*):
#   sources/<name>/<revision>/          verified local source mirror
#   builds/<preset-or-triplet>/<hash>/  content-addressed local build trees
#   prefixes/<triplet>/<build-hash>/    activated immutable prefixes
#   binary-cache/<artifact-hash>/       prebuilt kernel/solver operator cache
#   model-cache/<package-hash>/         model shards — never fetched on demand
#   test-tmp/                           scratch for tools/deps/tests
